# {{ category_name | title }} Challenges

## Difficulty Distribution
| Difficulty | Count |
|------------|-------|
{% for difficulty in ctf_config.difficulties %}
| {{ difficulty | title }} | {{ distribution.get(difficulty, 0) }} |
{% endfor %}

## Challenges ({{ challenges | count }} total)
{% if challenges | count == 0 %}
None
{% else %}
| Name | Folder | Description | Category | Difficulty | Author |
|------|--------|-------------|----------|------------|--------|
{% for challenge in challenges %}
{{ "| [" ~ (challenge.name | truncate(30)) ~ "](<./" ~ challenge.folder_name ~ ">)"
   ~ " | [" ~ (challenge.folder_name | truncate(30)) ~ "](<./" ~ challenge.folder_name ~ ">)"
   ~ " | " ~ (challenge.description | trim | truncate(100))
   ~ " | " ~ (challenge.category | title)
   ~ " | " ~ (challenge.difficulty | title)
   ~ " | " ~ challenge.author  ~ " |"
}}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}

## Services ({{ services | count }} total)
{% if services | count == 0 %}
None
{% else %}
| Service | Challenge | Ports | Type |
|---------|-----------|-------|------|
{% for service, challenge in services %}
{{ "| [" ~ (service.name | truncate(30)) ~ "](<./" ~ challenge.folder_name ~ "/" ~ service.path.as_posix() ~ ">)"
   ~ " | [" ~ (challenge.name | truncate(30)) ~ "](<./" ~ challenge.folder_name ~ ">)"
   ~ " | " ~ (service.ports | join(", "))
   ~ " | " ~ (service.type | title)  ~ " |"
}}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}